5. EMPIRICAL FACTS (sanity script, real pipeline)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- DuckDB names `SELECT COUNT(*)` column "count_star()".
- Box graph: 6 faces (face:0..face:5); face:0 has 4 EDGE_ADJACENT neighbours
  (face:2,3,4,5); 2-hop EDGE_ADJACENT closure from any face = all 6 faces.
- Box nodes table columns (19): node_id, label, area_cm2, centroid,
  component_id, convexity, curve_type, face_count, face_index,
  interior_angles, is_articulation_point, is_base_candidate,
  mean_curvature, normal_x, normal_y, normal_z, plane_id, triangle_count,
  vertex_count.
- Box edges table columns (8): source, target, relation, convexity,
  dihedral_angle_deg, extrusion_direction, orientation, shared_edge_length.
  (No VERTEX_TOUCH/SAME_ORIENTATION/COPLANAR edges on a box => no
  shared_vertex/shared_vertex_count/normal_dot/normal_x/y/z columns.)
- `SELECT area_cm2 FROM nodes` -> [4.0,4.0,4.0,4.0,4.0,4.0,None]
  (Component node has no area_cm2) => confirms the None-guard on sort is real.

